# Code owners for iv-cbv-payroll.
#
# GitHub looks for CODEOWNERS in only three locations -- ./CODEOWNERS,
# .github/CODEOWNERS, or docs/CODEOWNERS. This is the single source of truth;
# MAINTAINERS.md and README.md link here rather than duplicating the list.
#
# Syntax note: when several lines match the same path, only the LAST matching line
# applies. All owners for a pattern must therefore appear on a SINGLE line; listing
# them on separate `*` lines would leave only the final entry as owner.
#
# Owners must have write access to the repository, or GitHub ignores them.
#
# Requiring these reviews is a branch protection setting ("Require review from Code
# Owners" on main), not a property of this file. Adding the file alone changes
# nothing beyond auto-requesting review.

